# Only the API, the shared rules and the code entries go into the image — never the site, its
# images, or anyone's node_modules.
*
!aven/api/package.json
!aven/api/bun.lock
!aven/api/src
!maia/content/game
!maia/content/code
# the frozen engines the repo ships, which maia/content/game/code/sources/avendb.js holds code entries to
!aven/kernel/engines.js
!aven/kernel/sandbox/engines.json
# avenDB's WebAssembly, which checks the proof of the code the API runs (H2: maia/content/game/code/sources/feed.js `verifyProof`)
!aven/db/page/device/avendb_browser.js
!aven/db/page/device/avendb_browser_bg.wasm
